     "type": "Text",
     "attributeCode": "LongDescription",
     "attributeName": "Long Description",
     "values": [
      {
       "text": "The MP1-10R Pushbutton is: Momentary - Flush - Red - Non-illuminated - Black Plastic - No contact block\nThis Pushbutton is part of ABB's modular plastic range, the most versatile range with a high level of flexibility and market-leading electrical ratings. Engineered for total reliability, longer lifetime, and highest mechanical durability. Self-cleaning contacts ensure reliable operation without the need for maintenance, increasing uptime. A high degree of protection guarantees reliability in extreme environments. The innovative design simplifies the entire process, from selection to easy and quick, tool-free installation. The perfect solution for every application."
      }
     ],
